escription_en":"Two families, abolitionist Northerners the Stonemans and Southern landowners the Camerons, intertwine. When Confederate colonel Ben Cameron is captured in battle, nurse Elsie Stoneman petitions for his pardon. In Reconstruction-era South Carolina, Cameron founds the Ku Klux Klan, battling Elsie's congressman father and his African-American protégé, Silas Lynch.","description_fr":"Pendant la guerre de Sécession aux États-Unis, deux familles sont mises à l'épreuve : les Stoneman, favorables au Nord, et les Cameron, des sudistes. Le retour de la paix ne calme pas les esprits. Lincoln est assassiné. Les troubles naissent des politiciens véreux et des Noirs livrés à eux-mêmes. Par réaction se crée le Ku Klux Klan justicier et vengeur.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9MkgI1ObRVvJwWgJyWtRbgyWng.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4H4RAeeykpi0ijvu3wYgV346y06.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.9,"vote_count":625,"age_rating":"NR","year":"1915","release_date":"1915-03-08","runtime_minutes":195,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["دراما","تاريخ","حرب"],"genre_keys":["drama","history","war"],"similar":["mv256917","mv429351","mv616","mv250538","mv1016084","mv1020006","mv446791","mv759643"],"director":"D.W. Griffith","cast":[{"name":"ليليان غيش","character":"Stoneman's Daughter Elsie","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xUBj1vajDHS8GntuBzhpztRMVy4.jpg"},{"name":"Mae Marsh","character":"Flora Cameron","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1PDFSBQCwJ1yteuffEJgwSrAVra.jpg"},{"name":"Henry B. Walthall","character":"Col. Ben Cameron","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/v8G0OotHtSpp4iB2CBwWl9LFVkW.jpg"},{"name":"Miriam Cooper","character":"Margaret Cameron","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kJtdYZYTJV51qPleIMeKvdv2WHh.jpg"},{"name":"Mary Alden","character":"Stoneman's Housekeeper Lydia","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5pKYYHf6h7aiEJ